        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_back</span> Aday Arama EkranÄ±na DÃ¶n
      </a>
      <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold mb-1 text-[#1b1c1a] text-3xl" id="candidate-name-header">Aday Profili</h2>
      <p class="font-body-sm text-sm text-[#8a8580] font-medium" id="candidate-email-header">YÃ¼kleniyor...</p>
