          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-[#1b1c1a]">CV Ä°Ã§eriÄŸini GÃ¶rÃ¼ntÃ¼le</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#8a8580] max-w-[240px] mt-1 leading-relaxed">Sisteme yÃ¼klenen Ã¶zgeÃ§miÅŸin metin ve bÃ¶lÃ¼m detaylarÄ±nÄ± okumak iÃ§in soldaki listeden bir CV seÃ§in.</p>
